{{!
    @template plagiarism_essayguard/riskbadge

    Risk badge rendered inline on student submissions (plagiarism API get_links).

    v1.2.54: Pill with coloured dot indicator matching the Essay Guard docs demo.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * risklevel string Lower-case risk band, one of "low", "medium" or "high";
      used as the CSS modifier suffix on the badge element.
    * risklevelcap string The same risk band capitalised for display, e.g. "Medium".
    * riskscorepercent int Risk score as a whole-number percentage, 0 to 100.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "risklevel": "medium",
        "risklevelcap": "Medium",
        "riskscorepercent": 47
    }
}}
<span class="essayguard-risk essayguard-risk-{{risklevel}}">{{risklevelcap}} · {{riskscorepercent}}%</span>
